From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FreeCIE <freecie@localhost>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 14:56:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Sign through CieSigner, only with the card key

The JCA provider looked the card up through ReadCie, which pulls in the
SDK's NFC session, PACE and NIS classes. Use a small holder the app sets
while a card is connected instead.

Also reject keys that are not CiePrivateKey: the provider is inserted at
position 1 and must not capture RSA operations for other keys. And honour
offset/len, which were ignored.
